  "description": "2025 Sponsors Thank you to all of our sponsors! Become a Sponsor Spindles is accepting inquiries to sponsor the club for the upcoming 2025 season. Please fill out the form…",
  "bodyHtml": "<figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/b7d31fb9-7b14-4d86-9a1a-147bc5e9894e/10-19-macncheese-13.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span><strong>Thank you to all of our sponsors! </strong></span></p></div><figure><a href=\"https://guthdeconzo.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/3e6447fe-b020-4aad-bcd2-036cd62eb02d/Guth-logo.png?format=original\" alt=\"Gitch Deconzo logo with a green and black design.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"https://7brotherslandscaping.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/069deff0-c853-4602-891d-eadd5e8b4605/7-bros.png?format=original\" alt=\"Logo for 7 Brothers Landscaping with large number 7 and the words &quot;7 Brothers Landscaping&quot; underneath.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/primeausautobody/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/77e20a6a-5739-4244-8f23-146fb8880243/Primeau%27s.png?format=original\" alt=\"The logo of Primeau&#x27;s Autobody with bold navy blue text and a horizontal line underneath.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"https://beardigital.io\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/897b19b8-efb7-47ad-afd3-1c0317f2ecfc/bear-full.png?format=original\" alt=\"A black and gray logo for a24, an entertainment company.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"https://definedmassagetherapy.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/a5603ad4-b9e8-4946-8b91-ca59b04a222c/defined-color.png?format=original\" alt=\"A logo for Defined Massage Therapy featuring a stylized human figure with outstretched arms, integrated with a circuit-like design, with blue aromatic orbs along the body, and a blue crescent shape above.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"https://capitalregionembroidery.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/a1d1f5ab-2c29-4f1b-b94f-c3fddf0b56e3/cre-2-black.png?format=original\" alt=\"Logo of Capital Region Embroidery featuring embroidered initials and text.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/gentsbarbercompany/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/8b310654-88a3-48b8-8270-15a8ae28a9fe/gents-full.png?format=original\" alt=\"Stylized black-and-white logo with the text &#x27;Cento Barber Co.&#x27; in cursive and serif fonts, including a barber&#x27;s razor silhouette.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"https://shoptvoi.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/9f6d4aca-f4ee-4074-9d4a-2312b2559161/tvoi-full.png?format=original\" alt=\"A black and light blue graphic design with the word &#x27;Cov&#x27;, featuring a stylized microscope inside the letter &#x27;O&#x27;.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"https://www.twtsoccertraining.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/5fa79708-0c34-4915-9966-dffd9d99b035/TWT.png?format=original\" alt=\"A circular badge with pink, black, and cream colors featuring a stylized soccer ball in the center. The badge has the text &quot;TWT&quot; at the top and &quot;Soccer Training&quot; at the bottom, with numbers 20 and 24 on either side.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"https://www.23northcres.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/fcad6d1f-241d-453f-94a4-14c8403607e1/23+North+final+outlines-no+text.png?format=original\" alt=\"Logo of 23andMe with the text &#x27;23 &amp; 1/2 North&#x27; and an illustration of a DNA helix.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"https://cohoesanimalhouse.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/a923eefd-914d-482c-ad58-f51fce7565bb/ah-1-black.png?format=original\" alt=\"Logo of The Animal House Pet Grooming Salon featuring a gray cartoon dog with large eyes, wearing a purple bandana with initials &#x27;AH&#x27; and the text &#x27;The Animal House Pet Grooming Salon&#x27; in black\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Become a Sponsor</h3><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Spindles is accepting inquiries to sponsor the club for the upcoming 2025 season. Please fill out the form below and we will contact you with more information!</p></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/baa14a04-435d-4267-ba4b-342bd22987ca/4-23+Training-41.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"A man in a green T-shirt viewed from behind, standing outdoors against a cloudy sky.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/9d9180a8-a754-404e-99f4-552a6260d79e/12-3-tvoi-2.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"A smiling man wearing a blue sports shirt with the Spindles United Football Club logo and a navy blue cap with &#x27;7 Brothers Landscaping&#x27; logo.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Why Sponsor?</h3></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Spindles United is a unique Grassroots Club that prioritizes Community.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">100% of sponsorship funds raised for the club goes toward making each season a reality.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">This includes the ways we give back to the community.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Whether we are holding a free event like the <a href=\"/news/pc3n4jmv694libqfin9s5hpm3ceb3m\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Grassroots Cup</a>, or coaching <a href=\"/news/rwn84f84qncv1noq7xxch3cvpcv7zr\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cohoes Soccer Tots</a>.</p></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Sponsorships also play a crucial role in the development of our rostered players.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">By ensuring each player has the tools they need to succeed, Spindles as a collective can grow.</p></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Eager to Partner</h2></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Working with local businesses is one of the many rewards of running Spindles United FC.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Collaborations, sponsor events, etc.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">We want to work with you! Lets make it happen.</p></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/b897d485-8d86-4fa3-961f-00bb01f4c539/6-4-match-112.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"Soccer players in white jerseys celebrating on the field during a game.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure>",
